 ggml/src/ggml-cpu/repack-cache.cpp | 110 +++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 tests/test-repack-cache.cpp        |  90 ++++++++++++++++++++---
 tools/repack_cache.py              |  17 +++--
 4 files changed, 232 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)

