+| `corrupt-payload` | full payload xxh64 differs (VERIFY `full` only): pages restored to anonymous, repack, rewrite |
+| `unverified` | header lacks `verified=1` (VERIFY `once` or `full`): repack, rewrite |
+| `verify-failed`, `verify-mmap-failed` | the file just written did not hash back to the in-memory bytes: temp file removed, weights stay in memory |
